{"id":"vod_bf_41525","vodId":"41525","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"摇曳百合第二季","name_cn":"摇曳百合第二季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/0d13a77f8d4e2ad337bf6d1f9282147b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在氛围轻松制度宽松的七森中学，为了打发无聊的课后时光，个性天真单纯的少女赤座灯里（三上枝织 配音）伙同童年好友岁纳京子（大坪由佳 配音）与船见结衣（津田美波 配音），利用荒废已久的茶道社组成了一个名为“娱乐部”的活动社团。之后，又有表面善良内心却极为腹黑的女孩吉川千夏（大久保瑠美 配音）在误打误撞之中加入，就这样，这个山寨社团的四人小组成立了。　　在这个没有正式申请的社团中，每天都发生着欢乐又爆笑的日常，可是没过多久，娱乐部的存在便被学生会发现了。作为副部长，杉浦绫乃（藤田咲 配音）怎能对此坐视不管？在娱乐部和学生会之间，一场轰轰烈烈的猫鼠大战开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:05:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihedierji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:42.349Z"}